  "title": "Artichoke Tetrazzini",
  "description": "Mushrooms and onions sauteed in butter and thyme are combined with flour, chicken broth, half and half, Parmesan and the liquid from marinated artichoke hearts to make a rich and delicious sauce. Fold in the artichokes and serve over hot linguini.",
